# ==============================================================================
# ARCHITECTURAL HEADER: TESSERA / AI AGENT OS GITIGNORE CONTROL
# System: Tessera Enterprise & Local Agent Kernel System
# Role: Comprehensive Version Control Exclusion & Zero-Leak Security Enforcement
# Description: Defines repository exclusion rules across multi-language runtimes 
#              (TypeScript, Python, C++, Rust, Go), local flat-file memory stores,
#              zero-leak sandbox isolation environments, and sensitive key stores.
# Integration: Connected with src/lib/git-ignore-diagnostics.ts for kernel-level
#              integrity validation and pre-commit diagnostic audits.
# ==============================================================================

